# Compiled output
/dist
/tmp
/out-tsc
/bazel-out

# Dependencies
/node_modules
/?npm-debug.log*
/?yarn-debug.log*
/?pnpm-debug.log*
package-lock.json (Optional: some prefer to keep this, but standard Angular ignores it or tracks it depending on preference. Usually, keeping package-lock.json is recommended for apps).

